---
import "../styles/features.css";
---

<section class="features-section" id="features">
  <div class="features-container">

    <div class="features-heading">
      <p class="features-eyebrow">
        WHY THIS PROGRAM
      </p>

      <h2 class="features-title">
        將科技帶進醫療現場
      </h2>
      <span>
        人工智慧正在快速改變醫療與健康照護的工作方式。面對高齡化、照護人力不足、工作負荷增加與數位健康快速發展，
        未來的醫療照護人才除了專業知識，更需要具備理解科技、跨域溝通與解決真實問題的能力。
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">

      <!-- 01 -->
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <!-- Hospital -->
            <path d="M3 21V7h7v14" />
            <path d="M10 21V3h11v18" />
            <path d="M13 7h5" />
            <path d="M15.5 4.5v5" />
            <path d="M5.5 10h2" />
            <path d="M5.5 13h2" />
            <path d="M5.5 16h2" />
            <path d="M13 13h2" />
            <path d="M18 13h1" />
            <path d="M13 16h2" />
            <path d="M18 16h1" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>醫療照護現場正在改變</h3>
          <p>
            高齡化、慢性病與人力短缺，使臨床、長照及健康照護場域持續面臨工作負荷與流程改善需求。
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="feature-number">01</span>
      </article>


      <!-- 02 -->
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <!-- AI Chip -->
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2" />
            <path d="M9 3v3M12 3v3M15 3v3" />
            <path d="M9 18v3M12 18v3M15 18v3" />
            <path d="M3 9h3M3 12h3M3 15h3" />
            <path d="M18 9h3M18 12h3M18 15h3" />
            <text
              x="12"
              y="14"
              text-anchor="middle"
              font-size="6"
              fill="currentColor"
              stroke="none"
              font-weight="700"
            >
              AI
            </text>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>AI 正在進入醫療照護</h3>
          <p>
            AI、生成式AI、數位健康與智慧科技快速發展，醫療專業人員需要理解科技的能力，也需要知道它的限制與風險。
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="feature-number">02</span>
      </article>


      <!-- 03 -->
      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon-wrap">
          <svg class="feature-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <!-- People -->
            <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3" />
            <circle cx="5" cy="10" r="2" />
            <circle cx="19" cy="10" r="2" />

            <path d="M7 20v-2a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v2" />
            <path d="M1.5 19v-1a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4-3.5" />
            <path d="M22.5 19v-1a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-4-3.5" />

            <path d="M12 13v4" />
            <path d="M10 15h4" />
          </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-content">
          <h3>未來需要跨域人才</h3>
          <p>
            真正能推動智慧醫療落地的人才，不只是會使用工具，而是能理解場域問題、與不同專業溝通，並共同發展可行解方的人。
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="feature-number">03</span>
      </article>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>